* Thu Sep 10 2026 YUCLing <luotianyi@luotianyi.me> - 0.17.0-1
- Added AVS3-P3 decoding support.
- Added scheduled shutdown support.
- Added Pino logging.
- Desktop lyrics offset can now be adjusted with the mouse wheel.
- Added complete system media integration.
- Added a notification when resource packs are updated.
- Windows are now created on demand.
- Fixed proxy settings not being fully applied.
- Fixed auto-update settings not being saved.
- Fixed missing song covers in system integration for local music.
- Fixed touch screen support.
- Improved the desktop lyrics interaction experience.
- Refactored the Linux man-in-the-middle layer.
- Migrated from CJS to ESM.
- Refactored packaging.
- Updated dependencies and Electron.

